    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Standard-issue S'narchy Burger flat-top spatula, well-seasoned, slightly cursed by decades of overheard sarcasm. Hits about as hard as you'd expect and exactly as hard as it needs to.</p>\n<!-- BBTTCC:MECHANICS:START -->\n<hr/>\n<p><strong>⚙️ Mechanical Effects</strong></p>\n<p>Improvised melee. On a hit, you may make a withering remark — target rolls Resolve vs DC 11 or is Shaken until the end of its next turn.</p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Damage:</strong> 1d6 Kinetic damage to <em>Stress</em> <span style=\"opacity:.75\">(served with a side of commentary)</span></li>\n  <li><strong>Faculty:</strong> Presence</li>\n  <li><strong>Attack:</strong> Melee (Presence)</li>\n  <li><strong>Range:</strong> 5</li>\n  <li><strong>Duration:</strong> Scene</li>\n  <li><strong>Tier:</strong> T1</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- BBTTCC:MECHANICS:END -->"
    }
